com.bugsee.option.performance.enabled.iosProperty:
Master switch for the APM (Application Performance Monitoring) subsystem. Controls the in-process span/trace pipeline, which:

- Auto-instruments NSURLSession HTTP requests (one transaction per request);

- Auto-instruments NSData file reads/writes (file.read / file.write spans);

- Auto-instruments NSFileManager create / delete / copy / move / mkdir operations (file.* spans);

- Exposes the public Bugsee.startTransaction(...) / Bugsee.startSpan(...) API for manual instrumentation.

Captured transactions are written to every Bugsee report bundle. A standalone upload pipeline (gated by `performanceSampleRate` and `performanceAdaptiveSampling`) is reserved for a future revision and is not currently wired.
